{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はパシフィコ横浜で\n2nd アルバム それぞれの椅子\n最後の個別握手会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部から5部まで\n本当にたくさんの方が会いに来てくださり\n私がびっくりして、\n今日はなんかフワフワしてたと思いますっ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のブログ更新の後\n案の定全然寝付けなくて\n3時30分くらいまで起きちゃってた！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、いまね、全然眠くないの。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/11/6377884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BOMBさん\n発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/11/6377884/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影、本当にたのしかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/11/6377884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部は、ストレートに\n別れ際、もっと好きになるの衣装！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水色の自分の衣装です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://